    "updated_at": "2020-04-23T15:43:47Z",
    "body": "Class string (cf. #357) is a small thing that would be easy to make imperative. However, doing so in a non-confusing way is blocked on first making iterator prototype objects and async iterator prototype objects imperative, since for those two there's currently no algorithm to slot the \"create a `@@toStringTag` property\" step into.",
